{"id":"e692fe24a361915d9abb3fe88e0f591ea1fa5088","axis":"silent","repo":"rustwasm/wasm-bindgen","sha":"e692fe24a361915d9abb3fe88e0f591ea1fa5088","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -154,6 +154,15 @@","   `XrInputSourceArray::entries()` in web-sys.","   [#5458](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5458)"," ","+* Async exports taking `&mut self` or a `&mut T` argument now compile with","+  `panic=unwind`. The future returned to `future_to_promise` held the borrow","+  across an `.await`, which is never `UnwindSafe`. The receiver and arguments","+  are still required to be `RefUnwindSafe` / `UnwindSafe`, as for sync exports.","+  The future of an async export is no longer required to be `UnwindSafe` as a","+  whole, so values it holds across an `.await` are not checked, like the locals","+  of a sync export.","+  [#5474](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5474)","+"," ### Removed"," "," ## [0.2.130](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/compare/0.2.129...0.2.130)"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/js-sys/src/futures/mod.rs","lines":["@@ -365,6 +365,9 @@ where","     Promise::new(&mut move |resolve, reject| {","         let future = future.take().unwrap_throw();","         spawn_local(async move {","+            // A future whose poll panicked is dropped by the end of this","+            // statement and never polled again. `#[wasm_bindgen]` async","+            // exports rely on this to assert their future `UnwindSafe`.","             let res = future.catch_unwind().await;","             match res {","                 Ok(Ok(val)) => {"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/macro-support/src/codegen.rs","lines":["@@ -1348,10 +1348,21 @@ impl TryToTokens for ast::Export {","                     }","                 }","             } else {","+                // The arguments were checked to be unwind safe above (`Self:","+                // RefUnwindSafe` for `